  "interpretation": [
    "637 affected cases precede an index-allocation optimization; 87 final directed cases verify the current optimized resolver.",
    "48 floor cases exercise four published providers with current other dependencies, not a complete clean installed-runtime floor matrix.",
    "Baseline 14 failures expose absent per-record diagnostics. The first corrected draft had three invalid bond-order-column assumptions; the next draft exposed and corrected an over-restrictive alternate-serial policy against the existing fidelity guard.",
